        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's Last Hope is a shooter roguelike, inspired by &quot;Vampire Survivors&quot; and &quot;Seraph's Last Stand&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the enemies, level up, and build your own upgrade path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.poster.avif?t=1752880547\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.webm?t=1752880547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.mp4?t=1752880547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of upgrades avaliable, some of them will unlock a new power once they reach maximum level. These upgrades have a square on their icons corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/63920c30fd0177c35c2f2136c8023ae5.avif?t=1752880547\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the currency that you gain after the end of every round, buy new hats and weapons at the store. Combine them with the correct upgrade path and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/9bd802721e4e31238a64c4a42aeb7a05.avif?t=1752880547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras_big/9bd802721e4e31238a64c4a42aeb7a05.avif?t=1752880547 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game, so i really appreciate your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's Last Hope is a shooter roguelike, inspired by &quot;Vampire Survivors&quot; and &quot;Seraph's Last Stand&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the enemies, level up, and build your own upgrade path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.poster.avif?t=1752880547\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.webm?t=1752880547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/79cfce7966a3d21087a20bf1cba67720.mp4?t=1752880547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of upgrades avaliable, some of them will unlock a new power once they reach maximum level. These upgrades have a square on their icons corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/63920c30fd0177c35c2f2136c8023ae5.avif?t=1752880547\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the currency that you gain after the end of every round, buy new hats and weapons at the store. Combine them with the correct upgrade path and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras/9bd802721e4e31238a64c4a42aeb7a05.avif?t=1752880547\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830130/extras_big/9bd802721e4e31238a64c4a42aeb7a05.avif?t=1752880547 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game, so i really appreciate your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
